{"id":"vd-a2-the-shark-in-the-river","level":"a2","n":52,"title":{"en":"How Do We Know It's True?","vi":"Làm sao biết nó là thật?"},"summary":"Phòng báo trường, sáng thứ Hai: Felix muốn đăng ngay tin cá mập, còn Yara hỏi từng câu để kiểm chứng.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-shark-in-the-river","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Shark in the River","vi":"Con cá mập dưới sông"}},"scene":{"background":"office","props":[{"id":"laptop","x":800}]},"cast":{"felix":{"name":{"en":"Felix","vi":"Felix"},"look":"teenboy","x":520,"style":{"hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#C8A165","outfit":"shirt","top":"#4A90C2","topShade":"#3B78A5"}},"yara":{"name":{"en":"Yara","vi":"Yara"},"look":"teengirl","x":1150,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#B98160","skinShade":"#A06A4A","glasses":true,"outfit":"cardigan","top":"#C0504D","topShade":"#A64340"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"felix","en":"Yara, look! There's a shark in the river!","vi":"Yara, nhìn này! Có cá mập dưới sông!","ipa":["","lʊk","ðɛɹz","ə","ʃɑɹk","ɪn","ðə","ˈɹɪvɚ"],"start":0.554,"end":3.634,"expression":"surprised","prop":"laptop","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.169],[2,2.357],[3,2.622],[4,2.694],[5,3.066],[6,3.15],[7,3.247]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"Really? Where did you see that?","vi":"Thật à? Cậu thấy ở đâu vậy?","ipa":["ˈɹɪli","wɛɹ","dɪd","ju","si","ðæt"],"start":4.424,"end":6.284,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,4.424],[1,5.236],[2,5.467],[3,5.616],[4,5.739],[5,5.983]]},{"speaker":"felix","en":"Online. Everyone's sharing this photo.","vi":"Trên mạng. Ai cũng đang chia sẻ bức ảnh này.","ipa":["ˈɔnˌlaɪn","ˈɛvɹiˌwʌnz","ˈʃɛɹɪŋ","ðɪs","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ"],"start":7.074,"end":10.004,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,7.074],[1,8.452],[2,8.981],[3,9.378],[4,9.57]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"Hmm. Who took it?","vi":"Hừm. Ai chụp nó?","ipa":["hm","hu","tʊk","ɪt"],"start":10.794,"end":12.424,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,10.794],[1,11.674],[2,11.918],[3,12.177]]},{"speaker":"felix","en":"I don't know. Does it matter?","vi":"Tớ không biết. Chuyện đó quan trọng à?","ipa":["aɪ","doʊnt","noʊ","dʌz","ɪt","ˈmætɚ"],"start":13.214,"end":15.354,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,13.214],[1,13.278],[2,13.495],[3,14.671],[4,14.863],[5,14.971]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"Of course it matters. How do we know it's real?","vi":"Tất nhiên là quan trọng. Làm sao mình biết nó là thật?","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","ɪt","ˈmætɚz","haʊ","du","wi","noʊ","ɪts","ɹil"],"start":16.144,"end":18.914,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,16.144],[1,16.262],[2,16.575],[3,16.67],[4,17.652],[5,17.911],[6,17.992],[7,18.114],[8,18.291],[9,18.44]]},{"speaker":"felix","en":"Because thousands of people have shared it!","vi":"Vì hàng nghìn người đã chia sẻ nó!","ipa":["bɪˈkɔz","ˈθaʊzəndz","ʌv","ˈpipəl","hæv","ʃɛɹd","ɪt"],"start":19.704,"end":21.624,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,19.704],[1,20.007],[2,20.512],[3,20.608],[4,20.956],[5,21.1],[6,21.437]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"That doesn't make it true. It might be fake.","vi":"Thế đâu có nghĩa là nó thật. Nó có thể là ảnh giả.","ipa":["ðæt","ˈdʌzənt","meɪk","ɪt","tɹu","ɪt","maɪt","bi","feɪk"],"start":22.414,"end":25.134,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,22.414],[1,22.563],[2,22.848],[3,23.025],[4,23.134],[5,23.967],[6,24.198],[7,24.456],[8,24.605]]},{"speaker":"felix","en":"But it looks so real. Look at that fin!","vi":"Nhưng trông thật lắm mà. Nhìn cái vây kìa!","ipa":["bʌt","ɪt","lʊks","soʊ","ɹil","lʊk","æt","ðæt","fɪn"],"start":25.924,"end":28.884,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,25.924],[1,25.996],[2,26.117],[3,26.381],[4,26.645],[5,27.917],[6,28.17],[7,28.266],[8,28.458]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"Can sharks even live in rivers?","vi":"Cá mập có sống được ở sông không nhỉ?","ipa":["kæn","ʃɑɹks","ˈivɪn","lɪv","ɪn","ˈɹɪvɚz"],"start":29.674,"end":31.394,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,29.674],[1,29.812],[2,30.233],[3,30.492],[4,30.722],[5,30.845]]},{"speaker":"felix","en":"I'm not sure. Maybe some can?","vi":"Tớ không chắc. Chắc vài loài được?","ipa":["aɪm","nɑt","ʃʊɹ","ˈmeɪbi","sʌm","kæn"],"start":32.184,"end":34.784,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,32.184],[1,32.306],[2,32.499],[3,33.795],[4,34.131],[5,34.372]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"Let's ask an expert before we write anything.","vi":"Mình hỏi chuyên gia trước khi viết gì đi.","ipa":["lɛts","æsk","æn","ˈɛkspɚt","bɪˈfɔɹ","wi","ɹaɪt","ˈɛniˌθɪŋ"],"start":35.574,"end":38.214,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,35.574],[1,35.719],[2,36.005],[3,36.168],[4,36.766],[5,37.173],[6,37.309],[7,37.622]]},{"speaker":"felix","en":"OK. And let's check where the photo came from.","vi":"Được. Và mình kiểm tra xem bức ảnh từ đâu ra nữa.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","ənd","lɛts","tʃɛk","wɛɹ","ðə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","keɪm","fɹʌm"],"start":39.004,"end":42.294,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,39.004],[1,40.314],[2,40.495],[3,40.759],[4,41.084],[5,41.216],[6,41.312],[7,41.649],[8,41.925]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"Good idea. If it's fake, that's our story.","vi":"Ý hay đấy. Nếu nó là giả, đó chính là tin của mình.","ipa":["ɡʊd","aɪˈdiə","ɪf","ɪts","feɪk","ðæts","ˈaʊɚ","ˈstɔɹi"],"start":43.084,"end":46.264,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,43.084],[1,43.181],[2,44.15],[3,44.395],[4,44.599],[5,45.197],[6,45.468],[7,45.618]]},{"speaker":"felix","en":"A story about a shark that isn't there?","vi":"Một bài báo về con cá mập không hề có thật à?","ipa":["ə","ˈstɔɹi","əˈbaʊt","ə","ʃɑɹk","ðæt","ˈɪzənt","ðɛɹ"],"start":47.054,"end":48.864,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,47.054],[1,47.102],[2,47.499],[3,47.739],[4,47.787],[5,48.172],[6,48.352],[7,48.593]]},{"speaker":"yara","en":"Exactly. But first, the facts.","vi":"Chính xác. Nhưng trước hết là sự thật đã.","ipa":["ɪɡˈzæktli","bʌt","fɝst","ðə","fækts"],"start":49.654,"end":52.304,"expression":"happy","react":{"felix":"thinking"},"timing":[[0,49.654],[1,50.768],[2,51.054],[3,51.597],[4,51.733]]}],"words":[{"id":"photo","en":"photo","ipa":"ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","vi":"ảnh; bức ảnh","level":0},{"id":"share","en":"share","ipa":"ʃɛɹ","vi":"chia sẻ; phần; cổ phần","level":0},{"id":"real","en":"real","i